# Docker build context: never send build output, local secrets or private docs to the daemon / build cache.
# `**/` patterns also match nested copies (e.g. a stray `.dev/` or keys file in a sub-folder).
target/
**/.dev/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.keys.env
**/*.keys.env.bak-*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
.git/
docs/private/
docs/contracts/
docs/MIGRATION_PLAN.md
docs/PHASE0_PROGRESS.md
